WEBVTT

00:00:27.932 --> 00:00:31.808
gdje to sve odlazi?

00:00:31.808 --> 00:00:35.700
I s tim sam pitanjem uronila

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.724
u svijet sanitacija --

00:00:39.724 --> 00:00:41.289
ima toga još -- (Smijeh) --

00:00:41.289 --> 00:00:45.858
sanitacija, zahoda i kakice,

00:00:45.858 --> 00:00:48.931
i još uvijek nisam izronila.

00:00:48.931 --> 00:00:51.236
A to je zato što taj svijet razbjesni,

00:00:51.236 --> 00:00:54.452
ali i zaintrigira čovjeka.

00:00:54.452 --> 00:00:57.708
Da se vratim na onaj zahod,

00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:00.502
nije on bio profinjen,